{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHEW4MPSFW2X94MSWY6J","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHEWYENDFFYWC3Z463CY","name_zh":"犬牙參差","name_en":"Jagged Tooth","alphabet":"J","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["萬法大全"],"explicit_sources":["萬法大全"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["萬法大全"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"巡林客","level":2,"note":""},{"class":"德魯伊","level":3,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"德魯伊 3,巡林客 2","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"變化系","subschool":"","descriptors":[],"components":"V、S","casting_time":"標準動作","range":"鄰近（25 尺+5 尺/每 2 等級）","target":"一個天生武器為揮砍或穿刺的生物","area":"","effect":"","duration":"十分鐘/每等級","saving_throw":"意志過則無效（無害）","spell_resistance":"可（無害）","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"當你完成這法術時,你感到你的牙齒突然變得尖銳。施展法術時 ,一道魔法能量環繞著你\n指定的目標,增強目標的肌肉力量,令目標的武器更致命\n當目標的天生武器為揮砍或穿刺時,此法術令目標的天生武器重擊威脅範圍加倍。此效\n果不和其他重擊威脅範圍增加的效果疊加","description_en":null,"source_pages":[668,668],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"9a47a8f4f08f3639982d6a1289f128ace040bad073ebaa51efedf894d006c021","heading":"犬牙參差（Jagged Tooth）（萬法大全）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHEWMQ2TCVCDEB6DR133","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHEWHK64AXMPZG27PM5C","name_zh":"海鰻之顎","name_en":"Jaws Of The Moray","alphabet":"J","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["風暴之書"],"explicit_sources":["風暴之書"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["風暴之書"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"德魯伊","level":2,"note":""},{"class":"術士/法師","level":2,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"德魯伊 2，術士/法師 2","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"變化系","subschool":"","descriptors":[],"components":"V, S","casting_time":"標準動作","range":"接觸","target":"接觸到的生物","area":"","effect":"","duration":"1 分鐘/等級","saving_throw":"意志通過則不受影響（無害）","spell_resistance":"可（無害）","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"這個法術賦予目標齧咬攻擊，造成如下表所示的傷害。當被作為主要攻擊時，它能將生\n物的力量調整值加到傷害上。它也可以與人造武器結合起來作為次要天生武器攻擊。這種次\n要攻擊並不像副手武器一樣干擾主要攻擊，但是受術者在用齧咬進行次要天生武器攻擊時將\n如常受到-5 的減值（如果有多重攻擊 Multiattack 專長則為-2）\n如果生物咬中則會附著在敵人身上並且每輪自動造成齧咬傷害。這無需進行擒抱檢定且\n不引發借機攻擊。一個附著的攻擊者失去 AC 上的敏捷加值。當附著在敵人身上時無法使用\n其他武器，但被擒抱的敵人每次攻擊都需要進行一個擒抱檢定 。（It cannot use other weapons\nwhile attached, but each attack upon from the grappled foe requires a successful grapple\ncheck. ）其他人可以使用武器或擒抱攻擊附著的生物。若要借助擒抱移除附著生物，敵人\n必須能夠壓制附著生物。\n一個本身就能夠進行齧咬攻擊的生物可以選擇使用自己的齧咬傷害，同時也獲得附著在\n敵人身上的能力。\n体型 伤害\n超微型 1d2\n微型 1d3\n超小型 1d4\n小型 1d6\n中型 1d8\n大型 2d6\n超大型 2d8\n巨型 4d6\n超巨型 4d8","description_en":null,"source_pages":[668,669],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"ab8c4c6f0f7ef19d4c138982105bef421db2cef8fdd2cb4bbf27251bc41d9f52","heading":"海鰻之顎（Jaws Of The Moray）（風暴之書）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHEXJSPKAWJTB6ZZQSVS","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHEXAW9VMJ9RK1MN4C5X","name_zh":"狼之顎","name_en":"Jaws Of The Wolf","alphabet":"J","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["萬法大全"],"explicit_sources":["萬法大全"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["萬法大全"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"德魯伊","level":4,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"德魯伊 4","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"變化系","subschool":"","descriptors":[],"components":"V、S、F","casting_time":"標準動作","range":"鄰近（25 尺+5 尺/每 2 等級）","target":"","area":"","effect":"創造一個或更多的座狼（worg）","duration":"一回合/每等級（可解消）","saving_throw":"無","spell_resistance":"無","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"你撒一定數量的木雕在地上,那些木雕馬上變成成年座狼（worg）,那些座狼的下巴流著\n唾液對著你的敵人咆哮\n你將一些木雕轉化成一定數量的座狼（worg, MM 256）,數量為每 2 施法者等級一隻,這\n些座狼在你與敵方之間出現,這些狼有自主的意志但服從你的精神暗示。如果那些座狼離開\n你的法術有效範圍或你的法術效果完結時 ,那些座狼重新變回木雕。座狼死亡時 ,木雕也會被\n破壞\n施法材料：相等於你召喚數量的木雕（一個 25GP）","description_en":null,"source_pages":[669,669],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"c0bd5fa332d30d415c451034f9a21e7cc248754a6150c002c277f9d6461677e6","heading":"狼之顎（Jaws Of The Wolf ） （萬法大全）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHEX63KN9FVZZ14W5V3G","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHEX5KAETCCWMDX6TGYT","name_zh":"蒸汽噴射","name_en":"Jet Of Steam","alphabet":"J","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["完美巫師"],"explicit_sources":["完美巫師"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["完美巫師"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"巫覡","level":1,"note":"水"},{"class":"術士/法師","level":1,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"術士/法師 1，巫覡 1（水）","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"塑能系","subschool":"","descriptors":["水"],"components":"V，S","casting_time":"一個標準動作","range":"30 尺","target":"","area":"30 尺直線","effect":"","duration":"立即","saving_throw":"反射通過則減半","spell_resistance":"可","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"你釋放出一道強力的高溫蒸汽對區域中每個生物造成每施法者等級 1d4 火焰傷害（最\n多 5d4），蒸汽始於你的指尖。\n蒸汽噴射對路徑上的物體不會造成傷害，也不會點燃易燃物。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[669,669],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"c512c3ef1fc8c9c7e59532642dc57290829cc9cf645ec25abb7813fd41148ca5","heading":"蒸汽噴射（Jet Of Steam）（完美巫師）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHEXBJ9HBMS2ANWEZZW1","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHEX51BVKVSEVCJTQ5SW","name_zh":"波浪舞曲","name_en":"Jig Of The Waves","alphabet":"J","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["風暴之書"],"explicit_sources":["風暴之書"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["風暴之書"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"吟游詩人","level":2,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"吟游詩人 2","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"附魔系","subschool":"脅迫","descriptors":["影響心靈"],"components":"V, S","casting_time":"標準動作","range":"近距（25ft.+5ft./2 等級）","target":"","area":"10ft.半徑爆發內的一個或多個生物","effect":"","duration":"專注+1d4 輪","saving_throw":"意志通過則無效","spell_resistance":"可","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"你讓一個或更多的生物跳起歡快的快步舞。這個法術影響等同于施法者等級HD 的生物。\nHD 最低的生物最先受影響。對於 HD 相同的生物，最靠近法術原發點的先受影響。不足以\n影響生物的剩餘 HD 數則被浪費。\n跳舞的生物在攻擊檢定，豁免，技能檢定，屬性檢定以及 AC 上受到-2 減值，持續到法\n術結束。然而他們依然可以如常進行動作（使用上述的減值），他們無法操縱自己的移動。\n一個影響的生物每輪都必須用一個移動動作以她一半的速度向一個隨機方向移動。如果\n這種移動會讓目標處於危險的境地（例如跳入火中或者跳下甲板），那麼舞蹈將在生物即將\n受到威脅前停止。目標依然選擇在移動前或移動後做出動作。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[669,670],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"fbb51a61517910abbadbdf22741a82800635ae8e7cd95005426a4baaada4a1b1","heading":"波浪舞曲（Jig Of The Waves）（風暴之書）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHEXZGJ4BDG7AF90JXFZ","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHEX1KKH8E9F6X4PXFEQ","name_zh":"歡樂之音","name_en":"Joyful Noise","alphabet":"J","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["完美冒險"],"explicit_sources":["完美冒險"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["完美冒險"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"吟游詩人","level":1,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"吟游詩人 1","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"防護系","subschool":"","descriptors":[],"components":"S","casting_time":"標準動作","range":"10 尺","target":"","area":"以你為半徑，半徑 10 尺內的彌漫範圍","effect":"","duration":"專注，見說明","saving_throw":"不可","spell_resistance":"可","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"你站在地上跺跺你的腳，你的腳下產生一道波紋狀的噪音，釋放抑制沉默的聲響。\n你所造成的音波震動抑制了你所在區域內的任何魔法沉默效果，這個區域隨著你的移動\n而移動，直到你停止集中精力。沉默效果不是被驅散而是被抑制，它將在歡樂之音的有效範圍\n外繼續起效。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[670,670],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"c850b8cb4054b413a0386651745828fb00215dc6504a1426cb15fb977235f166","heading":"歡樂之音（Joyful Noise） （完美冒險）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHEXYDDZ65E0WZVYPFR0","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHEXNHYBHSPDM7XGSY1P","name_zh":"跳躍術","name_en":"Jump","alphabet":"J","source_access":{"kind":"basic","sources":[],"explicit_sources":[],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":[],"default_character_creation":true},"levels":[{"class":"巡林客","level":1,"note":""},{"class":"德魯伊","level":1,"note":""},{"class":"術士/法師","level":1,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"德魯伊 1，巡林客 1，術士/法師 1","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"變化系","subschool":"","descriptors":[],"components":"言語，姿勢，材料","casting_time":"一個標準動作","range":"接觸","target":"接觸到的生物","area":"","effect":"","duration":"1 分鐘/每等級（可解消）","saving_throw":"意志，通過則無效（無害）","spell_resistance":"可","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"受術者在跳躍技能檢定上獲得+10 增強加值。當施法者等級為 5 時該增強加值增加為\n+20，當施法者等級為 9 時該加值增加為+30（此時達到最大）。\n法術材料：一隻蚱蜢後腿，在施法時折斷。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[671,671],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"f75a7b0cc8707d3aecdffdd23fc6dea9a998280658c75c03ade4c00b39391173","heading":"跳躍術（Jump）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHEX9VMVNV43DFWFEDJZ","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHEXDA2ZC1YPRF3VVYYK","name_zh":"叢林之傷","name_en":"Jungle's Rapture","alphabet":"J","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["萬法大全"],"explicit_sources":["萬法大全"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["萬法大全"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"德魯伊","level":5,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"德魯伊 5","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"變化系","subschool":"","descriptors":[],"components":"V、S","casting_time":"標準動作","range":"鄰近（25 尺+5 尺/每 2 等級）","target":"一個非植物的活物","area":"","effect":"","duration":"永久（可解消）","saving_throw":"意志過則無效","spell_resistance":"可（無害）","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"嘶的一聲,你詛咒一個活物並得知他死亡的日子 ,當你注視著他的時候,物件的身體變得\n僵硬,然後皮膚表面產生木紋\n受此法術影響的活物失去 1d6 點敏捷。對象的身體慢慢硬化,皮膚緩慢地轉變成木材,被\n害者每天損失 1d6 點敏捷。即使損失的敏捷回復,被害者依然每天都會流失 1d6 點敏捷。當\n被害者的敏捷變成 0 時,被害者馬上變成和被害者大小的樹木 ,即使使用了變化型法術,此樹木\n視為一個沒有智力,感知和躲力值的普通的植物\n叢林之傷是一個不可抵消的詛咒,但可以被破除結界（Break Enchantment）,有限祈願術\n（Limited Wish）,神跡術（Miracle）或是祈願術（Wish）除去,但其施法者等級必需等於或高\n於你施展叢林之傷時的施法者等級。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[671,673],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"279f676b63b0af41a5a147a2cac1e35a362413667ea71a6780c6c4a2a57770bb","heading":"叢林之傷（Jungle's Rapture ） （萬法大全）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHEXQWW5HJW66XNDXGXP","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHEXE6YAXZXMJSEXPR57","name_zh":"叢林毀滅者","name_en":"Junglerazer","alphabet":"J","source_access":{"kind":"expansion","sources":["萬法大全"],"explicit_sources":["萬法大全"],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":["萬法大全"],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"德魯伊","level":3,"note":""},{"class":"術士/法師","level":3,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"德魯伊 3,術士/法師 3","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"死靈系","subschool":"","descriptors":[],"components":"V、S、M","casting_time":"標準動作","range":"120 尺","target":"120 尺的線","area":"","effect":"","duration":"即時","saving_throw":"反射過則減半","spell_resistance":"可（無害）","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"一道隱形的破壞能量向前安靜地劃過,立即破壞範圍內所有自然生命並留下一道灰燼的\n痕跡\n範圍內的精類、蟲類、植物和動物受到每施法者等級 1d10 點的傷害（最多為 10d10）\n法術材料：一撮燒焦的植物的灰燼","description_en":null,"source_pages":[671,671],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"816a4b33c460484056707a5cc2be4876934353725fc2fd23919ffc77c8e02453","heading":"叢林毀滅者（Junglerazer） （萬法大全）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHEXH8MWB4M06B5VVJHT","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHEXF8KNV5TVMEGV3PDE","name_zh":"龍王的公正","name_en":"Justice Of The Wyrm King","alphabet":"J","source_access":{"kind":"unresolved_expansion","sources":["龍之魔法"],"explicit_sources":[],"inferred_sources":["龍之魔法"],"raw_source_labels":[],"default_character_creation":false},"levels":[{"class":"術士/法師","level":7,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"術士/法師 7","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"防護系［力場］","subschool":"","descriptors":[],"components":"言語，姿勢","casting_time":"一個迅捷動作","range":"個人","target":"你","area":"","effect":"","duration":"5 回合","saving_throw":"","spell_resistance":"","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"從你的身體上向外射出黃色的明亮光芒，看起來就像是你被發光的尖刺所覆蓋了一樣。\n你創造出圍繞著自己的奧法力場領域，它會對攻擊你的人造成報復性傷害。在法術有效\n期間，任何使用非接觸（nonreach）近戰武器攻擊你的生物都會受到 4d6 傷害。\n如果你是術士，你能夠額外犧牲一個最高 9 級的法術位作為施法的一部分；犧牲的法術\n位元的每個等級會使傷害加 2。例如，如果你使用了一個 7 級法術位以施放該法術，並犧牲\n了一個 5 級法術位來強化它，你就會對攻擊者造成 4d6+10 點傷害。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[670,671],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":["source_inferred_not_relational"],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"69af31babed2bb1198e42a6fefa7811e6b81a7be26dba632eac6dfa83fe2dbeb","heading":"龍王的公正（Justice Of The Wyrm King）（龍之魔法）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
